# career-ops cron jobs for linux-claw.
# Install with: crontab deploy/crontab   (run as the `claw` user, from ~/career-ops)
# View installed jobs with: crontab -l
# Remove with: crontab -r
#
# Runs every Monday 06:00 local time (server timezone). Logs to
# ~/career-ops/deploy/discover.log so failures survive after cron discards
# stdout/stderr.

0 6 * * 1 cd /home/claw/career-ops && ./deploy/discover-companies.sh >> /home/claw/career-ops/deploy/discover.log 2>&1
